            "notes": "## Round 1 ##\n---\n### \u26a1 Powers: ###\n- [Double Helix](item_808afc07-1398-4962-bf2c-f8e3b74014e3) is just the GOAT to start out on Soldier for now; it will enable the next powers to all gain exponential value, even if you go with the optional ones\n- [Super Visor](item_b3db0ab0-26b4-4d99-893d-175f6726c9e9) might be the play if you look at the enemy comp and almost nobody is easy to hit with a helix; take this power first and we will lean more into the weapon damage side of things, while keeping the self-sustain Final Boss stuff that makes this build so strong\n---\n### \ud83d\udca3 Items: ###\n- [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) gets us more Helix damage and Biotic Field healing\n- [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) for more damage...\n- [Ammo Reserves](item_982d53aa-5ef4-493f-93e7-9e374d0ebf34) to help just spamming damage for more early-game money\n---\n### \u2699\ufe0f Optional Items: ###\n- [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) is of course another strong pick here\n- [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) will always be useful, especially early game, the other items are centered around gaining money but if you see a [Genji](hero_31fd201d-2f46-41e4-b125-9fa9e55fed46) on the enemy team, maybe grab this\n- [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) isn't amazing here but gets you more self-healing which really seems to help with early-game cash\n---\n### \ud83c\udfae Playstyle: ###\n- [Soldier: 76](hero_e1ac7ef5-4648-4998-b8b0-9e3da3e60546) will not really play any differently here yet, but do try to lean into having the extra [Double Helix](item_808afc07-1398-4962-bf2c-f8e3b74014e3) damage and snag grounded squishy kills whenever possible",
