            "notes": "## Round 2 ##\n---\n### \ud83d\udca3 Items: ###\n- [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) is a great start to the build because it effects everything we want: weapon damage, Helix damage, survivability, and money\n---\n### \u2699\ufe0f Optional: ###\n### - Don't be afraid to take many optional Weapon Damage items like [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) or even go for a sneaky  [Freja](hero_e80840a1-845d-4008-966c-585b7cb4a424) style kill with a [Bomb Diffusal Boots](item_c555901e-1b69-4040-8420-ee81cbaf6d90) instead if you went with [Super Visor](item_b3db0ab0-26b4-4d99-893d-175f6726c9e9) vs the intended path from here forward, even if there isn't a specific write-up for it in the notes ###\n- [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) will be a recurring item from here on in the Optional section; if there's a [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49) blocking the way or anyone with lots of shields or armor that you're after, this should be worked in with another weapon focused blue\n- [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) can be a great compliment with both weapon damage and cooldown help for Helix and Biotic Field\n- Depending on how the previous round went, pick from any of the **Optional** items; whether you have extra money and are adding something, or are swapping some out due to your current needs and cash flow, get what you need\n---\n### \ud83c\udfae Playstyle: ###\n- Similar to Round 1, your won't play too differently yet but lean into your Helix on stationary squishies and play your life\n- [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) overhealth will help keep your health high, plan ahead with this if you're expecting a dive",
