            "notes": "## Round 3 ##\n---\n### \u26a1 Powers: ###\n- [Hunker Down](item_bfe7eeda-26d6-464a-9478-6c4a388d1577) combined with your growing ability power (which increases Biotic Field healing) should really start to make you tanky\n- [Frontliners](item_20863047-0978-4bcd-b75f-499fac432ff0) is also totally good to take early if you need more burst heal than sustain\n### \ud83d\udca3 Items: ###\n- [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) and [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) to continue the weapon damage + Helix and Biotic Field output + cooldowns theme\n---\n### \u2699\ufe0f Optional: ###\n- [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) could be great to take early but I really like to have [Pulse Converter](item_a93a8a8e-28d1-4b02-8d80-3234f9eea3dc) with it for the ammo after Helix\n- [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) can start to stack with [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) if you really need to punch through a tank with high armor quickly\n- Depending on how the previous rounds went, pick from any of the **Optional** items; whether you have extra money and are adding something, or are swapping some out due to your current needs and cash flow, get what you need\n---\n### \ud83c\udfae Playstyle: ###\n- Make sure your Helix isn't deflected or eaten if you're getting pushed, you really want that [Hunker Down](item_bfe7eeda-26d6-464a-9478-6c4a388d1577) to activate",
