            "notes": "## Round 4 ##\n---\n### \ud83d\udca3 Items: ###\n- [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) gives the all-important weapon damage while also giving you an almost constant 25% ability power boost\n- Combine this extra ability power window from [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) with the extra ammo from [Pulse Converter](item_a93a8a8e-28d1-4b02-8d80-3234f9eea3dc) for big output\n---\n### \u2699\ufe0f Optional: ###\n- [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) can start to stack with [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) if you really need to punch through a tank with high armor quickly\n- [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) can be nice if you're really getting bullied\n- Depending on how the previous rounds went, pick from any of the **Optional** items; whether you have extra money and are adding something, or are swapping some out due to your current needs and cash flow, get what you need\n---\n### \ud83c\udfae Playstyle: ###\n- Start to focus on keeping [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) up before using Helix or Biotic Field to make sure you get the ability power boost; the [Pulse Converter](item_a93a8a8e-28d1-4b02-8d80-3234f9eea3dc) makes sure you have follow-up kill ammo after any Helix though",
