            "notes": "## Round 5 ##\n---\n### \u26a1 Powers: ###\n- [Frontliners](item_20863047-0978-4bcd-b75f-499fac432ff0) makes it official that you will be a true terror, each Helix will give you tons of overhealth on demand; it works for *both* shots from [Double Helix](item_808afc07-1398-4962-bf2c-f8e3b74014e3) *and* the regular Biotic Field\n- If you are truly being left alone, consider taking [Cratered](item_5bb876bf-52b5-496c-a9ea-b68e72ed3be1) early, but this is pretty rare the higher you climb\n---\n### \ud83d\udca3 Items: ###\n- [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429) continues the Helix damage + Biotic Field output marathon and really makes your weapon output shine after each ability use\n---\n### \u2699\ufe0f Optional: ###\n- [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) can start to stack with [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) if you really need to punch through a tank with high armor quickly\n- [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) can be nice if you're really getting bullied\n- Depending on how the previous rounds went, pick from any of the **Optional** items; whether you have extra money and are adding something, or are swapping some out due to your current needs and cash flow, get what you need\n---\n### \ud83c\udfae Playstyle: ###\n- The overhealth from [Frontliners](item_20863047-0978-4bcd-b75f-499fac432ff0) applies for both the regular Biotic Field **and** from [Hunker Down](item_bfe7eeda-26d6-464a-9478-6c4a388d1577) so use as needed\n- Try to keep the buff from [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) up before using Helix or Biotic Field to make sure you get your the ability power boost",
